WEBVTT

00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:03.520
I'm gonna be the first-star idol one day!

00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:07.650
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:10.150 --> 00:00:15.490
A multimillionaire from Russia held an audition to find a designer for a new fashion brand.

00:00:15.950 --> 00:00:20.870
Lily-senpai was Four Star Academy's representative.

00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:27.500
Her passion for dress design reached the heart of the judge and led her to victory.

00:00:28.130 --> 00:00:32.590
However, that only inspired Lily-senpai to dream even bigger.

00:00:32.590 --> 00:00:38.350
Her new dream is to wear a self-designed Premium Rare Dress after she makes S4.

00:00:38.970 --> 00:00:41.850
I have to work even harder to catch up to her.

00:00:41.850 --> 00:00:45.980
Nijino Yume, ready to up my Aikatsu with eyes on S4! {assume an "I'm" is in front here}

00:00:59.280 --> 00:01:02.370
Let's see, which to get today...

00:01:02.910 --> 00:01:03.910
Of course! Choco—

00:01:03.910 --> 00:01:06.790
This is not the time for muffins!

00:01:06.790 --> 00:01:08.790
It's about to start without us!

00:01:11.090 --> 00:01:14.170
Gather round, the time is upon us.

00:01:14.170 --> 00:01:17.050
Have you all prepared for what's to come?

00:01:17.050 --> 00:01:19.430
What is she going on about?

00:01:19.430 --> 00:01:23.100
You know, the special drama they filmed here just a while back.

00:01:23.100 --> 00:01:25.140
It's about to air.

00:01:26.060 --> 00:01:30.940
For the sole purpose of mastering 
this role, I doubled my daily running.

00:01:30.940 --> 00:01:33.440
Such long days of training those were.

00:01:33.440 --> 00:01:36.780
Now I can look back fondly on those memories.

00:01:36.780 --> 00:01:39.450
Earth to Ako, it's about to start.

00:01:39.450 --> 00:01:42.370
Okay, let's watch it together!

00:03:19.010 --> 00:03:20.930
It's almost time!

00:03:21.430 --> 00:03:22.470
Five seconds left.

00:03:23.430 --> 00:03:25.430
Three, two,

00:03:25.430 --> 00:03:27.310
one, zero!

00:03:34.520 --> 00:03:36.820
Whatever is the matter, Miss?!{I'm planning to go Lady Hime/Miss or Lady for this}

00:03:36.820 --> 00:03:38.610
O-Over there...

00:03:42.660 --> 00:03:43.570
This card...

00:03:45.490 --> 00:03:47.290
"Under the glow of tomorrow's full moon,

00:03:47.290 --> 00:03:52.710
we shall alight to pilfer the Shiratori-held legendary Princess Diamond." {I usually cap words like this but I'm not feeling it this time}{I would actually prefer caps here}

00:03:52.710 --> 00:03:55.130
Signed, the Shadow Star Thieves. {for convenience, I'll write it as Star here and Stars without the thief part}

00:03:56.590 --> 00:03:59.010
Miss? Lady Hime!

00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:31.830
I'm coming in.

00:04:35.120 --> 00:04:38.880
Boss, I've brought the whole investigation squad.

00:04:41.260 --> 00:04:44.180
The reason I have summoned you is as you suspect.

00:04:44.180 --> 00:04:47.890
It's in regards to the warning letter sent to the Shiratori mansion.

00:04:48.600 --> 00:04:51.220
Thank you for your kindness.

00:04:51.220 --> 00:04:53.390
You were a huge help.

00:04:53.390 --> 00:04:55.060
Please don't mention it.

00:04:55.060 --> 00:04:57.060
What is your name?

00:04:57.060 --> 00:04:58.690
My name is...

00:04:59.270 --> 00:05:01.070
Oh no, I'm late!

00:05:02.110 --> 00:05:03.570
This card...

00:05:03.570 --> 00:05:07.280
It looks like a challenge from the Shadow Stars.

00:05:08.030 --> 00:05:10.330
They're looking down on the police!

00:05:15.500 --> 00:05:17.960
Calm yourself, Investigator Mahiru.

00:05:17.960 --> 00:05:19.880
Getting agitated would play into their hands.

00:05:19.880 --> 00:05:21.880
It's like Investigator Yozora says.

00:05:21.880 --> 00:05:26.470
Now's the time to band together and put those Shadow Stars under lock and key!

00:05:27.680 --> 00:05:28.970
Now that you mention it...

00:05:28.970 --> 00:05:31.810
What's on your mind, Investigator Tsubasa?

00:05:31.810 --> 00:05:37.650
Investigator Haruka's replacement was scheduled to transfer in today.

00:05:40.860 --> 00:05:43.480
I-I apologize for running late.

00:05:44.400 --> 00:05:47.360
Saotome Ako, reporting for duty!

00:06:08.550 --> 00:06:11.390
Saotome Ako, was it?

00:06:11.390 --> 00:06:13.600
You wasted no time in being late.

00:06:14.180 --> 00:06:15.980
I apologize.

00:06:15.980 --> 00:06:21.310
I know you've been on the street beat until now, 
but I assume you've heard of the Shadow Star Thieves.

00:06:21.310 --> 00:06:22.900
Yes, of course!

00:06:24.280 --> 00:06:26.690
Three elusive phantoms,

00:06:27.030 --> 00:06:31.200
they are female thieves who can swipe anything they lay their eyes on.

00:06:31.620 --> 00:06:37.080
Other than the fact that they're young women, their identities are cloaked in darkness.

00:06:38.250 --> 00:06:40.750
At least you came prepared.

00:06:40.750 --> 00:06:44.130
In any case, you're starting off as my assistant.

00:06:44.130 --> 00:06:45.760
I-I would be honored to!

00:06:46.050 --> 00:06:50.090
To think I would end up assistant to the super strict sleuth, Tsubasa-senpai...

00:06:50.090 --> 00:06:52.720
Our creed is to turn the crime scene over a hundred times.

00:06:53.100 --> 00:06:54.350
Let's go.

00:06:54.350 --> 00:06:55.100
Right!

00:06:57.980 --> 00:06:59.520
I see.

00:06:59.520 --> 00:07:02.940
No one reported any suspicious figures.

00:07:02.940 --> 00:07:04.020
Correct.

00:07:04.020 --> 00:07:09.650
At the time, I was alone in my room with that window open.

00:07:10.240 --> 00:07:13.120
That was when the card flew in,

00:07:13.660 --> 00:07:15.660
embedding itself into the wall.

00:07:16.700 --> 00:07:21.500
To start things off, I would like to examine the Princess Diamond they mentioned.

00:07:22.170 --> 00:07:25.500
We cannot allow that. It is a priceless Shiratori family jewel.

00:07:25.500 --> 00:07:27.800
We cannot display it so openly.

00:07:27.800 --> 00:07:29.260
I allow it, Yuri.{I get, but}{tch}

00:07:29.260 --> 00:07:31.180
But Lady Hime...

00:07:31.180 --> 00:07:37.310
We must allow the detectives into our full confidence in order to ensure the success of tonight's show.

00:07:44.310 --> 00:07:46.820
This is the Princess Diamond.{wenn you want to change it hast du die macht}

00:07:47.570 --> 00:07:50.360
It's... breathtaking.

00:07:50.360 --> 00:07:53.320
I can understand why the Shadow Stars are after it.

00:07:54.120 --> 00:07:56.120
M-My apurrlogies!

00:07:56.120 --> 00:08:00.450
If I may, what was this show you mentioned, Hime-san?

00:08:00.450 --> 00:08:04.630
It is a home party that we hold regularly.

00:08:04.630 --> 00:08:08.300
We invite guests and hold a special performance.

00:08:08.300 --> 00:08:12.590
The Shadow Stars must be planning to use it as an opportunity to steal the diamond.

00:08:12.590 --> 00:08:15.050
Would it be possible to cancel it?

00:08:15.050 --> 00:08:18.640
I'm afraid not. It would reflect badly on the Shiratori name.

00:08:20.680 --> 00:08:22.730
Who are the guests this time?

00:08:22.730 --> 00:08:28.070
The hit idol group, Yume, Rola, and Lily.

00:08:28.070 --> 00:08:32.070
Those famous idols?! I'm a huge fan!

00:08:32.070 --> 00:08:34.160
I'm so sorry...

00:08:35.450 --> 00:08:41.250
Understood. The Four Star police force offers you our full security deployment.

00:08:41.250 --> 00:08:43.040
We will be relying on you.

00:08:47.250 --> 00:08:49.250
You will find it over there.

00:08:54.180 --> 00:09:00.260
Esteemed guests, you have my deepest gratitude for attending this humble gathering.

00:09:00.260 --> 00:09:03.140
I am the current family head, Shiratori Hime.

00:09:05.020 --> 00:09:08.770
I have invited more wonderful guests to entertain you this year.

00:09:08.770 --> 00:09:11.440
Please enjoy this wonderful evening.

00:09:12.900 --> 00:09:15.150
All officers, report your status.

00:09:15.150 --> 00:09:17.410
Main gate, no abnormalities.

00:09:17.410 --> 00:09:18.820
Garden post?

00:09:18.820 --> 00:09:21.160
Doesn't look like there's anyone suspicious here.

00:09:21.160 --> 00:09:23.040
What about the back gate?

00:09:23.040 --> 00:09:25.540
I have nothing to report for the time being.

00:09:26.170 --> 00:09:32.130
U-Um, Investigator Tsubasa. We have a strict checkpoint set up for everyone entering the estate.

00:09:32.130 --> 00:09:34.470
I can't imagine anyone being able to sneak in.

00:09:34.470 --> 00:09:35.840
Investigator Ako.

00:09:35.840 --> 00:09:39.050
You won't get anywhere with such half-baked senses. {was thinking about half ripe, the half part is important because later she says one-third}

00:09:39.050 --> 00:09:41.810
One day, your negligence will cost you.{to avoid the other reading}{I see}

00:09:41.810 --> 00:09:43.560
Don't forget that.

00:09:45.810 --> 00:09:46.810
Right...

00:09:46.810 --> 00:09:50.940
It's about time for the show to start. Go patrol inside the building.

00:09:50.940 --> 00:09:51.820
Roger!

00:09:51.820 --> 00:09:53.280
I'm on it!

00:10:02.030 --> 00:10:04.450
She's right, I'm only half-baked.

00:10:05.000 --> 00:10:10.330
I need to arrest those Shadow Stars myself and get her to recognize me as a proper investigator!

00:10:13.420 --> 00:10:15.840
Hello, guests of the Shiratori estate!

00:10:16.300 --> 00:10:17.930
How are you doing?

00:10:20.840 --> 00:10:22.720
I'm Nijino Yume!

00:10:22.720 --> 00:10:24.720
I'm Sakuraba Rola.

00:10:25.060 --> 00:10:27.230
I am Shirogane Lily.

00:10:31.860 --> 00:10:33.610
I recognize those voices!

00:10:35.190 --> 00:10:36.860
The show...

00:10:36.860 --> 00:10:39.490
I wish I could see it too...

00:10:45.120 --> 00:10:46.450
Yuri-san!

00:10:48.120 --> 00:10:50.000
What happened?!

00:10:51.130 --> 00:10:53.340
Th-They got us...

00:10:53.340 --> 00:10:54.500
What?

00:10:55.130 --> 00:10:57.260
The Princess Diamond...

00:10:57.260 --> 00:10:59.470
It's been stolen!

00:11:11.850 --> 00:11:13.810
{screw this, you can't even read anything}

00:11:13.810 --> 00:11:16.320
They took it from right under our noses.{for the record, we are a "sneaked" group}

00:11:19.190 --> 00:11:24.200
Yuri-san, do you remember any distinguishing features of the person who assaulted you?

00:11:24.530 --> 00:11:30.960
No, I'm afraid I was attacked from behind while doing my rounds.

00:11:30.960 --> 00:11:34.210
This is... my fault.

00:11:34.210 --> 00:11:37.000
If I had only reacted more quickly!

00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:38.840
Save the blame for later.

00:11:42.380 --> 00:11:44.640
She's right.

00:11:44.640 --> 00:11:47.810
Right now, we need to find the culprit.

00:11:47.810 --> 00:11:49.890
Huh? But we know it was the Shadow—

00:11:49.890 --> 00:11:51.770
It was not the Shadow Stars.

00:11:51.770 --> 00:11:52.850
What?!

00:11:53.690 --> 00:11:56.270
There are two critical points.

00:11:56.270 --> 00:12:02.860
First, the Shadow Stars always mark a successful theft with a card.

00:12:03.660 --> 00:12:07.030
As if they're making fun of the police.{in general}

00:12:07.030 --> 00:12:08.910
And second,

00:12:08.910 --> 00:12:13.000
the Shadow Stars never injure anyone under any circumstance.

00:12:13.000 --> 00:12:14.830
Then who could it be?

00:12:18.710 --> 00:12:22.720
Investigators Yozora and Mahiru, question all of the guests.

00:12:22.720 --> 00:12:23.630
Roger.

00:12:23.630 --> 00:12:25.300
We'll take care of it.

00:12:25.640 --> 00:12:29.430
Investigator Yuzu, comb the crime scene for any clues we may have overlooked.

00:12:29.430 --> 00:12:31.060
I'm on it!

00:12:31.060 --> 00:12:33.190
Um, what about me?

00:12:33.190 --> 00:12:36.940
Investigations are best done on foot. Follow me.

00:12:36.940 --> 00:12:37.980
Understood!

00:13:29.490 --> 00:13:33.500
We couldn't get any useful eyewitness testimony.

00:13:34.080 --> 00:13:37.750
By the way, why were you eating a pork cutlet bowl in the interrogation room?

00:13:37.750 --> 00:13:42.210
Huh?! I-I was under the impression that was the proper course of action...

00:13:42.210 --> 00:13:44.920
It's supposed to be eaten by the person getting questioned.

00:13:46.090 --> 00:13:50.930
Unbelievable. Forget half-baked, you're not even one-third baked. {this is one of those weird hyphen thingss I'm sure}{yesss... I'll need to asssk the english sssnake the neksssst time I sssee him}

00:13:50.930 --> 00:13:52.770
I'm sorry...

00:14:00.900 --> 00:14:02.480
I'll lend you a hand.

00:14:02.480 --> 00:14:06.400
Thank you. It's difficult to put these up with just my left hand.

00:14:09.620 --> 00:14:10.410
What's this?

00:14:10.410 --> 00:14:16.540
Oh, I made this in an attempt to be useful to the investigation.

00:14:21.290 --> 00:14:22.840
Investigator Tsubasa.

00:14:23.670 --> 00:14:24.880
Find anything?

00:14:24.880 --> 00:14:26.840
Unfortunately not.

00:14:26.840 --> 00:14:30.180
Forensics couldn't pick up anything either.

00:14:30.180 --> 00:14:37.060
That would suggest that the culprit is someone who has free access to the mansion.

00:14:38.640 --> 00:14:42.310
So, mind telling us why we were summoned?

00:14:42.940 --> 00:14:45.820
Thank you for taking time out of your busy schedules.

00:14:45.820 --> 00:14:49.820
Are we here because you suspect us too?

00:14:51.110 --> 00:14:57.500
As a rule, the more singular a case is, the simpler the truth proves to be. {I could not find her exact quote, so I smushed together a few of Holmes' into this}{I'll take your taste on word or something}

00:14:57.500 --> 00:14:58.580
Who said that?

00:14:59.290 --> 00:15:02.580
They are the words of a great British detective.

00:15:02.580 --> 00:15:08.720
If it would benefit the Shiratori family, we will gladly cooperate with you.

00:15:08.720 --> 00:15:10.090
Thank you.

00:15:10.090 --> 00:15:12.300
<i>Wh-What now?</i>

00:15:12.300 --> 00:15:14.140
<i>Because I'm half-baked—</i>

00:15:14.140 --> 00:15:18.850
<i>No, because I'm only third-baked, I've caused so much trouble!</i>

00:15:19.140 --> 00:15:24.110
We would like to speak with each of you one at a time in separate rooms.

00:15:24.110 --> 00:15:27.030
You mean you're interrogating us?

00:15:27.030 --> 00:15:29.150
To be frank, yes.

00:15:29.950 --> 00:15:31.110
That gets me going.

00:15:31.110 --> 00:15:34.530
Come along now, we'll all go to different rooms.

00:15:35.740 --> 00:15:37.660
Does that include Lady Hime?

00:15:37.660 --> 00:15:38.950
I do not mind.

00:15:38.950 --> 00:15:40.210
But Miss!

00:15:41.830 --> 00:15:44.880
We have already brought our guests into the investigation.

00:15:44.880 --> 00:15:48.590
It would be improper for the hosts not to partake in it as well.

00:15:55.600 --> 00:15:58.770
I suppose I'm not exempted either. Please start your questioning.

00:15:59.730 --> 00:16:02.770
Um, before we begin...

00:16:03.270 --> 00:16:07.900
Please write a signed statement declaring that you will not tell any lies.

00:16:08.440 --> 00:16:10.860
That's a simple matter.

00:16:21.660 --> 00:16:22.660
I'm sorry.

00:16:22.960 --> 00:16:24.920
I cannot write well with my left hand.

00:16:25.580 --> 00:16:26.920
<i>Could that mean...</i>

00:16:28.380 --> 00:16:31.260
Yuri-san, regarding your poster...

00:16:32.260 --> 00:16:34.260
How did you write those words?

00:16:35.640 --> 00:16:41.140
Forgive me, but I must request that you show me the injury on your right hand.

00:16:43.140 --> 00:16:46.860
You figured it out, rookie investigator.

00:16:47.270 --> 00:16:50.030
If you want to see that badly...

00:16:50.030 --> 00:16:51.690
I'll just have to show you!

00:16:52.740 --> 00:16:54.910
Congratulations.

00:16:54.910 --> 00:16:57.910
And my condolences.

00:16:57.910 --> 00:17:01.160
With no other witnesses, I must simply eliminate you!

00:17:07.670 --> 00:17:08.880
Curses...

00:17:09.840 --> 00:17:10.920
This...

00:17:10.920 --> 00:17:12.760
It's the Shadow Stars!

00:17:17.180 --> 00:17:18.300
Yuri-san!

00:17:18.300 --> 00:17:19.350
What happened?

00:17:19.890 --> 00:17:21.970
Yuri-san is the culprit!

00:17:21.970 --> 00:17:22.980
What?!

00:17:22.980 --> 00:17:24.140
It can't be!

00:17:26.980 --> 00:17:31.980
<i>I spent years infiltrating the Shiratori estate to finally snatch the Princess Diamond.</i>

00:17:31.980 --> 00:17:34.070
<i>You'll have to pry it from my cold, dead hands!{also it's "cold, dead hands"}</i>

00:17:38.910 --> 00:17:40.410
Freeze!

00:17:48.540 --> 00:17:49.630
Investigator Mahiru!

00:17:50.460 --> 00:17:51.420
Where's Yuri-san?

00:17:51.420 --> 00:17:52.960
She escaped outside!

00:17:53.630 --> 00:17:57.340
Investigator Ako, change into the Exclusive Four Star Police Dress!

00:17:58.300 --> 00:17:59.640
At once!

00:18:09.560 --> 00:18:11.980
Police have the front gate on lockdown.

00:18:11.980 --> 00:18:14.530
Let's split up and block all the back entrances.

00:18:14.530 --> 00:18:15.030
Right!

00:18:15.940 --> 00:18:19.530
<i>Yuri-san knows this property like the back of her hand.</i>

00:18:19.530 --> 00:18:22.370
<i>She must have a means of escape hidden somewhere!</i>

00:18:24.080 --> 00:18:25.790
You won't get away!

00:18:28.250 --> 00:18:29.790
Out of the way!

00:18:30.540 --> 00:18:32.790
Even Yuzu can fall from trees! {even monkeys can etc. I don't feel like thinking up something now}{prwlte kai, stae fasse something about yuzu fruit tree something}

00:18:38.050 --> 00:18:42.010
I knew it'd be a good idea to prepare this for the worst case scenario.

00:18:45.350 --> 00:18:46.850
Looking for something?

00:18:47.350 --> 00:18:48.850
This, perhaps?

00:18:52.360 --> 00:18:53.650
There you are!

00:18:54.730 --> 00:18:56.490
Let's get her, Investigator Ako!

00:18:56.490 --> 00:18:57.860
Roger!

00:18:58.990 --> 00:19:01.110
You're under arrest!

00:19:15.630 --> 00:19:19.380
How about you hand over the Princess Diamond now.

00:19:19.380 --> 00:19:21.130
Fine.

00:19:22.550 --> 00:19:23.640
It's gone...

00:19:23.640 --> 00:19:25.720
Give it up already.

00:19:25.720 --> 00:19:28.640
It's true! I had it with me the whole time—

00:19:29.810 --> 00:19:32.150
Isn't that a Shadow Card?

00:19:32.150 --> 00:19:34.860
No way... but when?

00:19:38.190 --> 00:19:41.740
As forewarned, we have acquired the Princess Diamond. {fixed in post}

00:19:46.200 --> 00:19:48.200
Thanks for everything!

00:19:48.200 --> 00:19:50.370
Didn't that get you going?

00:19:50.370 --> 00:19:52.790
Curse you, Shadow Stars!

00:19:52.790 --> 00:19:54.130
Farewell, ladies.

00:19:54.460 --> 00:19:56.710
We bid you adieu.

00:20:07.060 --> 00:20:09.770
My deepest apologies, Boss.

00:20:10.390 --> 00:20:12.560
This is so frustrating.

00:20:12.560 --> 00:20:13.810
Investigator Ako.

00:20:13.810 --> 00:20:14.770
Yes?

00:20:14.770 --> 00:20:16.900
The diamond may have been stolen,

00:20:17.320 --> 00:20:23.660
but you were the one who saw through her 
false injury and preempted her getaway car.

00:20:23.660 --> 00:20:24.870
Pretty amazing.

00:20:24.870 --> 00:20:27.280
Th-Thank you very much.

00:20:27.280 --> 00:20:33.460
However, that just means you went from one-third to half-baked.

00:20:34.750 --> 00:20:40.590
<i>I, Saotome Ako, vow to work until the day she recognizes me as a full-fledged detective!</i>

00:20:41.800 --> 00:20:45.970
That's right, we never held the welcoming party for Investigator Ako.

00:20:46.550 --> 00:20:48.180
Let's head out for some lunch.

00:20:49.470 --> 00:20:51.390
Yay!

00:20:54.480 --> 00:20:56.310
That was so entertaining!

00:20:57.190 --> 00:21:00.820
I could hardly believe how good S4's acting was.

00:21:00.820 --> 00:21:04.450
I was a huge fan of Yuri-senpai's role as the culprit.

00:21:04.450 --> 00:21:07.070
She didn't even use a stunt double for the action scenes!

00:21:07.070 --> 00:21:11.160
Excuse me, but where's all the praise for my acting?

00:21:11.160 --> 00:21:14.120
Huh, you? It goes without saying—

00:21:14.120 --> 00:21:15.330
Saotome.

00:21:15.960 --> 00:21:17.880
Tsubasa-senpai?!

00:21:17.880 --> 00:21:20.090
I was watching the airing.

00:21:21.090 --> 00:21:23.260
U-Um, and your thoughts...

00:21:23.630 --> 00:21:27.510
That was a difficult role, but you played it well.

00:21:27.510 --> 00:21:33.180
Keep it up and you may be cast in that seasonal drama sooner than expected.

00:21:39.310 --> 00:21:41.270
Now, more importantly...

00:21:42.230 --> 00:21:44.530
Criticism Time!

00:21:46.280 --> 00:21:50.530
First is scene 1. Your spacing between lines was bad.

00:21:50.530 --> 00:21:55.460
Next, scene 4. What was with 
your acting? You looked like a puppet.{dare no tame ni ikiteiru no deshou ka}

00:21:55.460 --> 00:21:57.330
Act with more emotion.

00:21:57.330 --> 00:22:04.300
Scene 6. If you don't take more time, 
it'll lessen the impact of the vital lines.

00:21:59.790 --> 00:22:04.260
I was about to say that Ako-chan's acting was really good.

00:22:04.260 --> 00:22:08.680
But that strictness is the key to Theater Class's high level of performance.

00:22:04.300 --> 00:22:09.970
Then there's scene 7. You need to work harder to bring out the character of an investigator.

00:22:08.680 --> 00:22:13.930
It feels like S4 is pulling out all the stops in preparation for graduation.

00:22:09.970 --> 00:22:14.980
Also, you need to focus on your expressions as a way of conveying character.

00:22:13.930 --> 00:22:16.180
We have to get just as serious!

00:22:14.980 --> 00:22:17.480
Use your entire body to act.

00:22:16.180 --> 00:22:17.480
You bet!

00:22:17.480 --> 00:22:18.440
Fight!

00:22:18.440 --> 00:22:19.900
Yeah!

00:22:19.900 --> 00:22:21.440
Am I clear, Saotome?

00:22:22.070 --> 00:22:23.980
Yes!

00:24:10.380 --> 00:24:14.840
When the four classes come together, an epic battle will unfold.

00:24:14.840 --> 00:24:17.560
In a word, Winter Fest is upon us!

00:24:17.560 --> 00:24:19.680
Next time on Aikatsu Stars!

00:24:19.680 --> 00:24:21.730
Burn! Star Captor Fest! {this is weird}{"burn" is probably safer because stars burn brightly, and yeah this is weird, but I think catch/captor is also more likely to fit}

00:24:21.730 --> 00:24:24.060
Become the first-star idol!
